{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19864","headline":"自叹 · 孟郊","name":"自叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愁与发相形，一愁白数茎。\n有发能几多，禁愁日日生。\n古若不置兵，天下无战争。\n古若不置名，道路无欹倾。\n太行耸巍峩，是天产不平。\n黄河奔浊浪，是天生不清。\n四蹄日日多，双轮日日成。\n二物不在天，安能免营营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19864.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19864","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}